    "detailed_description": "Welcome to Brick Masters!<br><br>Brick Masters is a brick building game that allows you to build anything you can think of using bricks. Follow the premade worlds and use the instructions to build them brick by brick.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Advanced brick building system</strong> that allows you to build anything<br></li><li><strong>Sandbox mode</strong> that lets you build with no restrictions<br></li><li>Bombs and boulders to <strong>destroy your brick world</strong><br></li><li>Physics based system that allows you to <strong>collapse brick structures</strong><br></li><li><strong>Ragdolls</strong> characters that behave &quot;realistic&quot; when you throw them around</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features in development</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Chains:</strong> Build a chain from joints connecting two bricks<br></li><li>Share your creations on <strong>steamworks</strong><br></li><li><strong>Multiple Bombs:</strong> Various bomb each with different explosion effect<br></li><li><strong>Collisions:</strong> When an object with high speed collides with another it creates an explosion<br></li><li><strong>Motors:</strong> Use motors to make moving parts<br></li><li><strong>Environments:</strong> Different starting environments</li></ul><i>    ... and more coming!</i><br><br>Come join us on early access!",
